"sdp.overview.integrations.api.content" : "<p>Interfa\u0163a de programare aplica\u0163ii (API) v\u0103 ajut\u0103 s\u0103 integra\u0163i ServiceDesk Plus cu alte aplica\u0163ii externe. Utiliz\u00e2nd integr\u0103rile la nivel API, pute\u0163i s\u0103 face\u0163i schimb de date \u00eentre ServiceDesk Plus \u015fi alte aplica\u0163ii. Interfa\u0163a API este acceptat\u0103 de modulele Solicit\u0103ri, Active, CMDB \u015fi Modific\u0103ri din ServiceDesk Plus.</p>",
